flowchart TD
  U[Researcher UI] -->|commands, approvals| S[System: workflow engine, state machine, access control]
  S -->|assign step| O[Orchestrator]
  O -->|step command with entity references| S
  S --> CA[Context Assembler]
  CS[(Shared Context Store)] --> CA
  VDB[(Vector database)] -->|RAG evidence| CA
